  "family": "global",
  "lineage": "All-night song-dance of the Osing people of Banyuwangi at the eastern tip of Java, in which a professional female singer-dancer, the gandrung, sings and dances with male guests from evening until dawn. She is accompanied by one or two violins, kendang drumming, the small kethuk kettle gong, kempul and gong, and the kluncing triangle (here the concert-triangle card).",
